            <figure class="kg-card kg-image-card kg-width-wide"><img src="https://www.avlt.info/content/images/2025/12/WEB-JC101-1200x628-w-1.jpg" class="kg-image" alt="" loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1047" srcset="https://www.avlt.info/content/images/size/w600/2025/12/WEB-JC101-1200x628-w-1.jpg 600w, https://www.avlt.info/content/images/size/w1000/2025/12/WEB-JC101-1200x628-w-1.jpg 1000w, https://www.avlt.info/content/images/size/w1600/2025/12/WEB-JC101-1200x628-w-1.jpg 1600w, https://www.avlt.info/content/images/2025/12/WEB-JC101-1200x628-w-1.jpg 2400w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) 1200px"></figure><h1 id="john-cage-101">John Cage 101</h1><p>Written and directed by Matt Slaybaugh</p><p><strong>January 30th - February 1st, 2026</strong><br>Wexner Center for the Arts<br>1871 North High St</p><div class="kg-card kg-header-card kg-v2 kg-width-regular kg-style-accent" data-background-color="accent">

                <div class="kg-header-card-content">

                    <div class="kg-header-card-text kg-align-center">
                        <h2 id="sponsored-by-leigh-householder" class="kg-header-card-heading" style="color: #FFFFFF;" data-text-color="#FFFFFF"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Sponsored by </span><br><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Leigh Householder</span></h2>


                    </div>
                </div>
            </div><h3 id="featuring">Featuring: </h3><p><strong>Acacia Duncan</strong> –&nbsp;prepared piano, claves, vintage meat grinder<br><strong>Drew Eberly</strong> –&nbsp;toy piano, harmonica, trash cans full of water<br><strong>Ian Short</strong> –&nbsp;wooden flute, tambourine, paper scroll, sheet metal<br><strong>Meghan Durham Wall</strong> –&nbsp;&nbsp;tin flute, rattle can, caxixi shaker, wood waterfall</p><p><strong>Dave Wallingford</strong> –&nbsp;Production Manager / Sound<br><strong>Jaylene Jennings</strong> –&nbsp;Stage Manager / Costumes<br><strong>Meghan Durham Wall</strong> –&nbsp;Movement<br><strong>Carrie Cox</strong> –&nbsp;Lighting<br><strong>Lonelle Yoder</strong> –&nbsp;Properties<br><strong>J V. Uhlman</strong> –&nbsp;Assistant Director<br><strong>Whitney Thomas Eads</strong>&nbsp;– Graphics</p><h3 id="schedule"><strong>Schedule:</strong></h3><p>Friday, January 30th @ 7:00pm<br>Saturday, January 31st @ 7:00pm<br>Sunday, February 1st @ 3:00pm</p><p><strong>Pay What You Want</strong>&nbsp;available at the door on Friday, January 30.</p><div class="kg-card kg-cta-card kg-cta-bg-blue kg-cta-minimal    " data-layout="minimal">

                <div class="kg-cta-content">


                    <div class="kg-cta-content-inner">

